# Wiki

The source of truth for what the product does and what is promised: functional only, one folder per
functional domain (`wiki/<domain>/<topic>.md`). When this wiki and the code disagree, the wiki is right.

PILOT's phases write and read it (`/pilot-wiki`, `.pilot/pilot-link-wiki.md`). The `<!-- wiki: … -->` line
under each entry is written by `python3 .pilot/pilot.py wiki`, never by hand, and only a pull request
changes this folder.
